    "updated_at": "2016-04-26T15:21:23Z",
    "body": "Oh, and the above doesn't account for the HTML spec currently allowing heuristic sniffing. If you still want to allow that, it's probably easier to make the HTML spec use a distinct BOM sniffing hook than to let BOM sniffing in the HTML context be baked into \"decode\".\n",
